66617121-57db-4953-84ed-461e57e56339"],536873563]],["^15",[545,"^;","~u66617121-57db-4953-84ed-461e57e56339",536873563]],["^15",[546,"^Q","[Rootless Docker on WSL2 Nixos](https://www.richtman.com.au/blog/rootless-docker-on-wsl2-nixos/)",536873563]],["^15",[546,"^O","^16",536873563]],["^15",[546,"^F",545,536873563]],["^15",[546,"^X",543,536873563]],["^15",[546,"^V",545,536873563]],["^15",[546,"^U",543,536873563]],["^15",[546,"^;","~u66708968-0d36-4a0e-9391-1b2d2029ea77",536873563]],["^15",[547,"^Q","[Understanding PUID and PGID](https://docs.linuxserver.io/general/understanding-puid-and-pgid)",536873563]],["^15",[547,"^O","^16",536873563]],["^15",[547,"^F",546,536873563]],["^15",[547,"^X",543,536873563]],["^15",[547,"^V",545,536873563]],["^15",[547,"^U",543,536873563]],["^15",[547,"^;","~u66708968-7d9d-4af7-a43a-0b73c1e49747",536873563]],["^15",[548,"^Q","Podman\nid:: 6662b981-5b86-4f65-99f1-5f379bde0153",536873563]],["^15",[548,"^O","^16",536873563]],["^15",[548,"^F",545,536873563]],["^15",[548,"^X",543,536873563]],["^15",[548,"^V",543,536873563]],["^15",[548,"^U",543,536873563]],["^15",[548,"^?",["^ ","^1F","6662b981-5b86-4f65-99f1-5f379bde0153"],536873563]],["^15",[548,"^J",["^1F"],536873563]],["^15",[548,"^4",["^ ","^1F","6662b981-5b86-4f65-99f1-5f379bde0153"],536873563]],["^15",[548,"^;","~u6662b981-5b86-4f65-99f1-5f379bde0153",536873563]],["^15",[549,"^Q","Compose",536873563]],["^15",[549,"^O","^16",536873563]],["^15",[549,"^F",548,536873563]],["^15",[549,"^X",543,536873563]],["^15",[549,"^V",543,536873563]],["^15",[549,"^U",543,536873563]],["^15",[549,"^;","~u66708968-43be-4850-9172-7b359ac71473",536873563]],["^15",[550,"^3","tags:: finance\n\n- Involves two parties agreeing to a future transaction\n- Its value depends on (or derives from) the values of other underlying variables\n\t- These variables are often the prices of traded assets\n- uses:\n\t- hedging\n\t\t- Reduce the risk of potential future movements in a market variable\n\t- speculation\n\t\t- Bet on the future direction of a market variable\n\t- arbitrage\n\t\t- Take offsetting positions in two or more instruments to lock in a profit\n- Markets\n\t- exchange-traded markets\n\t  id:: 6662db30-d722-494a-a5b7-89c5f5f12347\n\t\t- Traders can be individuals or companies\n\t\t- Derivatives are traded under standardised contracts defined by the exchange\n\t\t- Transactions between traders are managed by the exchange\n\t\t- The exchange assumes the default risk of both parties in a transaction\n\t\t\t- Both parties are required to deposit funds (known as ((6662de08-5b76-4d46-aa44-030d2182ef1e)))\n\t\t\t  id:: 6662df69-aff6-4709-b8d8-c635c1256473\n\t\t\t- Traders do not need to be concerned about the creditworthiness of the counter-party\n\t\t-\n\t- over-the-counter (OTC) markets\n\t  id:: 6662df54-8323-47b2-916e-c4a3e641a02d\n\t\t- Participants: large financial institutions, fund managers and corporations\n\t\t- Once an OTC trade has been agreed, the two parties can either:\n\t\t\t- Present it to a central ((6662df9e-cfb2-401a-96d8-f5d49aaed5b5))\n\t\t\t- Clear the trade bilaterally\n\t\t- Large banks often act as ((6662e1f9-f6c9-4100-87bb-c7085423e2bc)) for the more commonly traded instruments\n\t\t- Before the 2008 financial crisis the OTC derivative markets were largely unregulated\n\t\t\t- After the financial crisis new regulations were implemented to improve transparency and reduce ((6662e5ae-3bda-4249-beab-be1e948ab483)) to the point of behaving in a similar way to ((6662db30-d722-494a-a5b7-89c5f5f12347))\n\t\t\t\t- Standardised contracts\n\t\t\t\t- Trades require a ((6662df9e-cfb2-401a-96d8-f5d49aaed5b5))\n\t\t\t\t- Trades must be reported to a central repository\n\t\t- Less trades than in ((6662db30-d722-494a-a5b7-89c5f5f12347)) but much larger volume per trade and total volume\n- Types\n\t- Spot\n\t- [[forward (future)]]\n\t- [[option]]\n\t- repos\n\t  id:: 6674a921-d46f-4adb-9b5d-a99ba47d7fa7\n\t\t- collateralised loans in which the ((66670527-36b8-48cb-a890-6c1eb573c785))s have to provide high-quality collateral, such as gilts, in exchange for receiving the loan",536878403]],["^15",[550,"^19",1718651240191,536873565]],["^15",[550,"^1:","~m1718921667476",536878402]],["^15",[550,"^Z","pages/derivatives.md",536873565]],["^15",[551,"^K",1718651240191,536873565]],["^15",[551,"^[",592,536873568]],["^15",[551,"^@",false,536873565]],["^15",[551,"^Y","forward (future)",536873565]],["^15",[551,"^11","forward (future)",536873565]],["^15",[551,"^B",1718651240191,536873565]],["^15",[551,"^;","~u6673cbeb-226b-430d-8b63-b5c74ae90d7f",536876396]],["^15",[552,"^K",1718651240191,536873565]],["^15",[552,"^[",629,536873574]],["^15",[552,"^@",false,536873565]],["^15",[552,"^Y","option",536873565]],["^15",[552,"^11","option",536873565]],["^15",[552,"^B",1718651240191,536873565]],["^15",[552,"^;","~u6673cbeb-fe2b-423f-830d-56d5637fa581",536876396]],["^15",[553,"^Q","After the financial crisis new regulations were implemented to improve transparency and reduce ((6662e5ae-3bda-4249-beab-be1e948ab483)) to the point of behaving in a similar way to ((6662db30-d722-494a-a5b7-89c5f5f12347))",536873565]],["^15",[553,"^O","^16",536873565]],["^15",[553,"^F",575,536873565]],["^15",[553,"^X",537,536873565]],["^15",[553,"^V",575,536873565]],["^15",[553,"^U",537,536873565]],["^15",[553,"^H",567,536876396]],["^15",[553,"^H",574,536876396]],["^15",[553,"^;","~u66708968-9b12-4072-b7e5-6b2d1ff3b9e2",536873565]],["^15",[554,"^Q","Trades must be reported to a central repository",536873565]],["^15",[554,"^O","^16",536873565]],["^15",[554,"^F",563,536873565]],["^15",[554,"^X",537,536873565]],["^15",[554,"^V",553,536873565]],["^15",[554,"^U",537,536873565]],["^15",[554,"^;","~u66708968-350b-475b-b023-ddd1f0a3b2e0",536873565]],["^15",[555,"^Q","Participants: large financial institutions, fund managers and corporations",536873565]],["^15",[555,"^O","^16",536873565]],["^15",[555,"^F",556,536873565]],["^15",[555,"^X",537,536873565]],["^15",[555,"^V",556,536873565]]